                                "sense_id": "845faa77-ba4e-395e-805c-5a6e5feef9b9",
                                "text": "The Gipsie snap & Pedro\nare none of Toms Comradoes,\nyͤ punck I skorne, & yͤ cutpurse sworn\n& yͤ roring boyes brauadoes"
                            }
